<title>DENMARK: FLS in maintenance deal with Caledonian.</title>
<headline>FLS in maintenance deal with Caledonian.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish engineering group FLS Industries said on Friday its U.K.-based FLS Aerospace unit signed a five year, 160 million crown aircraft maintenance deal with British Caledonian Airways.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the deal was &quot;a contract of considerable importance&quot; and covered component delivery and coordination as well as maintenance of British Caledonian's A320 passenger aircraft fleet.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
